29/Vote-Centers">Vote Centers</a></li><li><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/161295/General-2026-VP_FINAL">Local Voters&apos; Pamphlet</a></li><li><a href="https://www.sos.wa.gov/sites/default/files/2026-10/Voters%20Pamphlet%202026%20-%20Edition%2009%20-%20Pierce.pdf" aria-describedby="audioeye_pdf_message">State Voters&apos; Pamphlet</a></li><li><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/162069/BallotRetByDayMidtermGeneral">Ballots Returned by Day</a></li><li><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/162086/Ballots-Returned-by-District-Gen2026-1">Ballots Returned by District</a></li><li><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/161564/Sample-Ballot">Sample Ballot</a></li><li><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/161277/Nov-2026-Election-at-a-Glance">Election at a Glance</a></li><li><a href="https://www.piercecountywa.gov/7959/Current-Election">More...</a></li><li><br></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="elections-card"><div class="vol-card-image" style="background-image: url('/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=121764');"><br></div><div class="vol-card-cont"><div class="card-title">Voter Assistance</div><div class="vol-link-list row"><ul class="el-links"><li><a href="https://www.piercecountywa.gov/2883/Voter-Resources">How to Vote</a></li><li><a href="https://www.piercecountywa.gov/6547/Return-my-Ballot">Return my Ballot</a></li><li id="isPasted"><a aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" aria-label="Election FAQ’s Opens in new window" href="https://www.piercecountywa.gov/7016/Secure-Elections-and-Voter-Records---FAQ" rel="noopener" target="_blank">FAQ&rsquo;s</a></li><li><a href="https://www.piercecountywa.gov/335/Military-Overseas">Military/Overseas Voters</a></li><li><a href="https://www.piercecountywa.gov/6940/Voters-Experiencing-Homelessness">Voters Experiencing Homelessness</a></li><li><a href="https://www.piercecountywa.gov/333/Accessible-Voting">Voters Living With a Disability</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="elections-card"><div class="vol-card-image" style="background-image: url('/Im